---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Confide">
	<div class="container">
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="logo-group">
				<a href="/" class="logo">
					<img src="/favicon.svg" alt="Confide" class="logo-icon" />
					<span>Confide</span>
				</a>
				<span class="tagline">the simple <strong>secure</strong> form builder</span>
			</div>
			<div class="nav-actions">
				<ul class="nav-links">
					<li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
					<li><a href="#login">Log in</a></li>
				</ul>
				<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Sign Up Free</a>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="hero-badge">End-to-end encrypted</div>
				<h1>Sensitive forms that keep your respondents safe</h1>
				<p>Built for nonprofits, legal aid, and grassroots organizations. Protect the people who trust you with their most vulnerable data.</p>
				<div class="hero-actions">
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Sign Up Free</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="privacy-section">
				<div class="privacy-grid">
					<div class="privacy-title">
						<span class="muted-label">NO ADS, NO TRACKING</span>
						<h2>Break free from Big Tech</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="privacy-content">
						<p>Most companies make money by tracking your activity, profiling you, and serving you ads. We believe this is an invasion of your privacy. We don't do this, period.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="privacy-section">
				<div class="privacy-grid">
					<div class="privacy-title">
						<span class="muted-label">ENCRYPTED DATA</span>
						<h2>Your data stays yours — we can't read it even if we tried</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="privacy-content">
						<p>Forms are encrypted on your device before reaching our servers. Respondents use secure form links to decrypt your form and encrypt their responses. We cannot access this data even if we wanted to.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="privacy-section">
				<div class="privacy-grid">
					<div class="privacy-title">
						<span class="muted-label">SECURE WORKSPACE</span>
						<h2>Collaborate with your team</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="privacy-content">
						<p>Shared workspaces enable your team to work together while maintaining full data encryption with respondents. You have full control over who can see what — with clear audit logs of what was accessed and when.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="privacy-section">
				<div class="privacy-grid">
					<div class="privacy-title">
						<span class="muted-label">WHEN DATA IS SENSITIVE</span>
						<h2>Privacy isn't optional</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="privacy-content">
						<p>Whether you're collecting:</p>
						<ul class="feature-list">
							<li>incident or abuse reports</li>
							<li>immigration or legal case details</li>
							<li>whistleblower submissions</li>
						</ul>
						<p>A breach — or even internal misuse — can put real people at risk.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="highlights-section">
				<div class="highlights-grid">
					<div class="highlight-card">
						<span class="highlight-icon">
							<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
								<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
							</svg>
						</span>
						<h3>Only you can read submissions</h3>
						<p>Forms and responses are encrypted before they ever reach us. We cannot access them.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="highlight-card">
						<span class="highlight-icon">
							<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M17.94 17.94A10.07 10.07 0 0 1 12 20c-7 0-11-8-11-8a18.45 18.45 0 0 1 5.06-5.94"></path>
								<path d="M9.9 4.24A9.12 9.12 0 0 1 12 4c7 0 11 8 11 8a18.5 18.5 0 0 1-2.16 3.19"></path>
								<line x1="1" y1="1" x2="23" y2="23"></line>
							</svg>
						</span>
						<h3>Anonymous by default</h3>
						<p>No trackers. No IP logging. No hidden analytics.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="highlight-card">
						<span class="highlight-icon">
							<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
								<circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
								<path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
								<path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
							</svg>
						</span>
						<h3>Safe team collaboration</h3>
						<p>Workspaces, access controls, and audit logs — without exposing raw data unnecessarily.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="privacy-section">
				<div class="privacy-grid">
					<div class="privacy-title">
						<h2>Built for real-world use.</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="privacy-content">
						<p>Everything your organization needs to collect sensitive information responsibly.</p>
						<ul class="feature-list">
							<li>Auto-delete old responses to reduce risk</li>
							<li>Close forms automatically when needed</li>
							<li>Share via secure links or QR codes</li>
							<li>Encrypted forwarding when needed</li>
							<li>Multi-language support</li>
							<li>Passkey-only authentication</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="faq-section">
				<div class="faq-header">
					<h2>I have questions about security and our data…</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="faq-list">
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>Can Confide read my form responses?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>No. Forms and responses are encrypted on your device using keys only you control. By the time data reaches our servers it's already encrypted — we have no way to decrypt or read it.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>What happens if Confide gets hacked?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>An attacker would only obtain ciphertext. Without your private keys — which never leave your device — the data is unreadable. End-to-end encryption means a server breach exposes nothing meaningful.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>Do respondents need to create an account?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>No. Respondents receive a secure link that contains everything needed to decrypt your form and encrypt their response. No sign-up, no email, no tracking.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>Is Confide open source?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>Yes. Confide is licensed under AGPL, so anyone can inspect, audit, or self-host the code. Security claims you can verify are more trustworthy than ones you can't.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>What metadata does Confide collect?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>We collect only what's necessary to run the service — timestamps of form submissions and basic account information for paying customers. We do not log IP addresses of respondents, track behavior, or sell data.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
					<details class="faq-item">
						<summary class="faq-question">
							<span>Can I delete data automatically?</span>
							<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						</summary>
						<div class="faq-answer">
							<p>Yes. You can configure forms to auto-delete responses after a set period, or close a form entirely once a submission limit is reached. Reducing the data you hold reduces your risk.</p>
						</div>
					</details>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="final-cta">
				<div class="cta-content">
					<h2>Your data belongs to you — not tech companies, governments, or hackers.</h2>
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create a secure form</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="footer">
			<div class="footer-content">
				<div class="footer-brand">
					<img src="/favicon.svg" alt="Confide" class="logo-icon" />
					<span class="footer-logo-text">Confide</span>
				</div>
				<ul class="footer-links">
					<li><a href="#login">Sign in</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://status.confide.com">Status</a></li>
					<li><a href="/trust">Trust & Safety</a></li>
					<li><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
					<li><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 1.5rem;
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	/* Nav */
	.nav {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 1.5rem 0;
	}

	.logo-group {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.logo {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.logo-icon {
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
	}

	.nav-actions {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.nav-links a {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	.nav-links a:hover {
		color: var(--fg-color);
	}

	/* Hero */
	.hero {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 5rem 0 7rem;
	}

	.hero-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.375rem;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding: 0.3rem 0.875rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.hero-badge::before {
		content: '';
		display: inline-block;
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background-color: currentColor;
		opacity: 0.6;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 7vw, 3.75rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		color: var(--fg-color);
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.hero p {
		font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 2.5vw, 1.1875rem);
		color: var(--muted-color);
		max-width: 540px;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	/* Privacy Sections */
	.privacy-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.privacy-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.muted-label {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.privacy-title h2 {
		font-size: 2.125rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}

	.privacy-content p {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.privacy-content p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.feature-list {
		margin: 0.75rem 0;
		padding-left: 0;
	}

	.feature-list li {
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		padding: 0.3rem 0 0.3rem 1.25rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.feature-list li::before {
		content: '—';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--border-color);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	/* Highlights Section */
	.highlights-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.highlights-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.highlight-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.highlight-icon {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		color: var(--fg-color);
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	.highlight-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.25;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.highlight-card p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* FAQ Section */
	.faq-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.faq-header {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.faq-header h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.125rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.faq-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.faq-item {
		border-radius: 0.875rem;
		background-color: var(--secondary-bg);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.faq-question {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1.125rem 1.375rem;
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		cursor: pointer;
		list-style: none;
		user-select: none;
	}

	.faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
		display: none;
	}

	.faq-icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 1.25rem;
		height: 1.25rem;
		position: relative;
		color: var(--muted-color);
	}

	.faq-icon::before,
	.faq-icon::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		background-color: currentColor;
		border-radius: 2px;
		transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
	}

	.faq-icon::before {
		width: 100%;
		height: 1.5px;
		top: 50%;
		left: 0;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
	}

	.faq-icon::after {
		width: 1.5px;
		height: 100%;
		left: 50%;
		top: 0;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	details[open] .faq-icon::after {
		transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);
		opacity: 0;
	}

	.faq-answer {
		padding: 0 1.375rem 1.25rem;
	}

	.faq-answer p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	/* Final CTA */
	.final-cta {
		padding: 7rem 0;
		text-align: center;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.cta-content {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.final-cta h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 4.5vw, 2.375rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}

	/* Buttons */
	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.5rem 1.125rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		transition: all 0.2s;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.btn-lg {
		padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background-color: var(--primary-color);
		color: var(--primary-fg);
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		opacity: 0.85;
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background-color: var(--secondary-bg);
		color: var(--fg-color);
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background-color: var(--secondary-hover);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	/* Footer */
	.footer {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.footer-content {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: var(--muted-color);
	}

	.footer-brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.footer-logo-text {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--fg-color);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: var(--fg-color);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.container {
			padding: 0 1.25rem;
		}

		.nav-links {
			display: none;
		}

		.tagline {
			display: none;
		}

		.nav {
			padding: 1rem 0;
		}

		.nav-actions {
			gap: 0.5rem;
		}

		.hero {
			padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem;
		}

		.hero h1 {
			letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		}

		.hero-actions {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 220px;
			margin: 0 auto;
		}

		.hero-actions .btn {
			width: 100%;
		}

		.privacy-section {
			padding: 3rem 0;
		}

		.privacy-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.75rem;
		}

		.privacy-title h2 {
			font-size: 1.875rem;
		}

		.highlights-section {
			padding: 3rem 0;
		}

		.highlights-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.final-cta {
			padding: 5rem 0;
		}

		.cta-content {
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.footer-content {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 2rem;
			text-align: center;
		}

		.footer-brand {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.5rem;
		}

		.footer-links {
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
